    "founder-block": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "founder-heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From The Founder",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "founder-body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>During my own healthy-ingredients journey, I flipped over the box of my toothpaste and saw the warning: <em>do not swallow.<\/em> Why was I putting something in my mouth that wasn't safe to swallow?<\/p><p>From that moment, our family set out to make an effective toothpaste without fluoride — or anything else that would be harmful to swallow. Every ingredient in this tube is food-grade or food-derived. That's not marketing copy. That's the line we drew, and we won't cross it for profit.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
